msgid "Using Security with .properties File"
msgstr "使用.properties文件的安全性"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Quarkus provides support for properties file-based authentication intended for development and testing purposes.\n"
"It is not recommended to use this authentication in production as, at present, only plain-text and MD5 hashed passwords are used, and properties files are generally too limited."
msgstr "Quarkus 支持基于属性文件的身份验证，该功能主要用于开发和测试。不建议在生产环境中使用此身份验证方式，因为目前仅支持明文密码和 MD5 哈希密码，且属性文件的限制通常较多。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Add the following to your build file:"
msgstr "在您的构建文件中添加以下内容："

#, fuzzy
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The elytron-security-properties-file extension currently supports two different realms for storing authentication and authorization information.\n"
"Both support storage of this information in properties files."
msgstr "elytron-security-properties-file 扩展目前支持两种不同的领域，用于存储身份验证和授权信息。这两种领域都支持将此类信息存储在属性文件中。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "The following sections detail the specific configuration properties."
msgstr "以下各节详细介绍了具体的配置属性。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Basic authentication must be explicitly enabled with `quarkus.http.auth.basic=true`, if more than one authentication mechanism is used."
msgstr "如果使用了多种身份验证机制，则必须通过 `quarkus.http.auth.basic=true` 显式启用基本身份验证。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "<span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-lock\" title=\"Fixed at build time\"></i></span> Configuration property fixed at build time - All other configuration properties are overridable at runtime <input type=\"search\" id=\"config-search-1\" placeholder=\"FILTER CONFIGURATION\" disabled>"
msgstr "<span class=\"icon\"><i class=\"fa fa-lock\" title=\"在构建时固定\"></i></span> 配置属性在构建时固定 - 所有其他配置属性均可在运行时覆盖 <input type=\"search\" id=\"config-search-1\" placeholder=\"过滤配置\" disabled>"

